@startuml selma_directive_lifecycle
' ============================================================
' Selma — Directive Lifecycle State Machine
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §2.2, §2.2.4, §2.3, §2.5
'          User_Stories.md S-01, S-02, S-03, S-08, S-19, S-20, S-26
' C4:      Application Service + Directives Adapter → directive_store
'          Hermetic Compiler on every publish / identity op
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' Dual identity:
'   lineage_id   = immutable root (Machine ID at creation)
'   execution_id = active node identity (changes on fork/merge/split)
' Status enum (schema): draft | active | deprecated | superseded
' Ownership / events / concurrency: README.md
' Split capability: directive.fork (v8.2.4; no directive.split matrix row)
' ============================================================

title Selma — Directive Lifecycle FSM\n<size:12><i>Status path · dual-identity ops · parent deprecation · hermetic recompile</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> Draft : <b>directive.create</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: directive.create]\naction: lineage_id := Machine ID\naction: execution_id := lineage_id\naction: authored_by := actor\nevent: DirectiveCreated\nstory: S-01

state "Draft" as Draft #B9770E : **entry** mutable drafting\n**allowed** modify · publish compile\n**forbidden** retire · fork · merge · split\n**identity** lineage_id + execution_id fixed
state "Active" as Active #2C6E49 : **entry** published & operational in CG-IR\n**allowed** modify · retire · supersede\n**allowed** fork · merge · split\n**forbidden** create (new root uses Draft)
state "Deprecated" as Deprecated #4A4A4A : **entry** retired / absorbed parent\n**allowed** restore only\n**forbidden** fork · merge · split · modify body\nCG-IR nodes marked deprecated
state "Superseded" as Superseded #4A4A4A : **entry** replaced by successor\n**allowed** read-only audit trail\n**forbidden** restore without successor governance\nmetadata.migration.superseded_by required

state "Fork Children\n(spawn)" as ForkChildren #1B7A6E : **entry** 2 new execution_ids\nshared lineage_id\nlineage.operation = fork\nparent → Deprecated\nchildren enter Draft
state "Merge Result\n(spawn)" as MergeResult #1B7A6E : **entry** binary merge only (v8.2.x)\nlineage_id = MIN(parents) lex\nexecution_id = lineage_id + "-M" + SHA-256(...)[0:16]\nboth parents → Deprecated\nchild enters Draft
state "Split Children\n(spawn)" as SplitChildren #1B7A6E : **entry** N new execution_ids\nshared lineage_id\nlineage.operation = split\nparent → Deprecated\nchildren enter Draft

' ---------- Status transitions ----------
Draft --> Draft : <b>directive.modify (revision)</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: directive.modify]\naction: lineage_id unchanged · execution_id unchanged\nevent: DirectiveRevised\nstory: S-02
Draft --> Active : <b>directive.modify (publish)</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official + System\n[capability: directive.modify]\n[hermetic compile SUCCESS]\naction: new CG-IR snapshot published\nevent: DirectivePublished\nstory: S-01 / S-02

Active --> Active : <b>directive.modify (revision)</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: directive.modify]\n[exclusive write lock · compile SUCCESS]\naction: same lineage_id + execution_id\nevent: DirectiveRevised\nstory: S-02
Active --> Deprecated : <b>directive.retire</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: directive.retire]\naction: reason recorded · CG-IR nodes deprecated\nevent: DirectiveRetired\nstory: S-03
Active --> Superseded : <b>directive.modify (supersede)</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: directive.modify]\n[superseded_by → active|draft id · successor compile-validated]\nevent: DirectiveSuperseded\n§2.2.4

Deprecated --> Draft : <b>directive.restore</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: directive.restore]\naction: target revision copied · lineage_id preserved\n[must recompile to re-activate]\nevent: DirectiveRestored\nstory: S-08

' ---------- Identity operations ----------
Active --> ForkChildren : <b>directive.fork</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: directive.fork]\naction: parent side-effect Deprecated\nevent: DirectiveForked\nstory: S-19
Active --> MergeResult : <b>directive.merge</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: directive.merge]\naction: both parents side-effect Deprecated\nevent: DirectiveMerged\nstory: S-20
Active --> SplitChildren : <b>directive.split</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: directive.fork]\n[N-ary split shares fork gate (v8.2.4)]\naction: parent side-effect Deprecated\nevent: DirectiveSplit\nstory: S-26

ForkChildren --> Draft : <b>spawn children</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: materialize child rules\naction: new execution_id instances · Draft status\nevent: DirectiveChildrenSpawned
MergeResult --> Draft : <b>spawn merged rule</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: materialize merge result\naction: new execution_id · Draft status\nevent: DirectiveChildrenSpawned
SplitChildren --> Draft : <b>spawn children</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: materialize child rules\naction: new execution_id instances · Draft status\nevent: DirectiveChildrenSpawned

' Stable sinks (entity records persist). Superseded has no outgoing
' edges → UML final. Deprecated is not final: restore remains enabled.
Superseded --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

@enduml
